      ["Two fingers apart", "Scale the model"],
      ["Two-finger twist", "Turn the model when twist is enabled"],
      ["Two-finger drag", "Move the model on the screen"],
      ["Lock Ground Plane", "Stay upright and slide on the ground"],
      ["?", "Open or close this help"]
